{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "940c097c494c95cca49fccbefa9d6d3a2ac6cb90591ca152f3c4e6db8a33bcde", "ja": "古代からの呼び声", "zh": "来自古代的呼唤", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2872756acb9921b2f451a812793dafc87608675621e630786d85908607a37886", "ja": "百合子は星梨花に、古代魔法に近い場所を\n教える代わり、千鶴とエレナが戦えるよう\n協力してほしいと、彼女のコンプレックスを\n刺激しつつ焚きつける。歌織とパートナーの\n風花は、近頃生徒の怪我が多い事に気付く。", "zh": "百合子告诉星梨花，只要她愿意教自己接近古代魔法的地方，\n就会帮助千鹤和艾蕾娜能够战斗；一边刺激着她的自卑心，\n一边煽动她。歌织和搭档风花注意到，最近学生受伤的情况\n似乎变多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "4e68a60b65fc4b1e1bee3b97f6d2e53e31731df70c57dcccd2789c464a4866a5", "ja": "……ふぅ。やっと撒けたみたい。\nしつこいんだから。", "zh": "……呼。总算是甩掉了。\n真是死缠烂打。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "fb90832b9b42b11e387f31e8089c5fd1fc3823c954d383ed9ae1904194f3b483", "ja": "千鶴さんは、どうしてわたしの邪魔をするんだろう。\n古代魔法の素晴らしさが、わからないのかな……。", "zh": "千鹤小姐为什么要妨碍我呢？\n难道她不明白古代魔法的美妙之处吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "3199e845ea716d302c22c1adc536f2c4b331af6ebb4aa4c233d2e5073e2a5c7e", "ja": "本当に、古代魔法がお好きなんですね……？", "zh": "您真的很喜欢古代魔法呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "259b4886d9cb4b99ffcffd660a4117cff0aa645d7356c5b16ab0c84d17532f69", "ja": "ひゃんっ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "58247af7edd97cc7db30425420f0d9884bea4e4eeadc3dc70e34c2354add388e", "ja": "あ、驚かせてごめんなさい！　ええと……私、\n百合子です。星梨花さんと同じ、魔瞳の大鷲寮の。", "zh": "啊，吓到你了，对不起！呃……我叫百合子。和星梨花一样，都是魔瞳的大鹰宿舍的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "065ac6a7eda4835e030354a83608294caf252a124f3f4fc5d659a25a9b244bec", "ja": "……ああ、あの魔法オタクの……。\nわたしに何か用ですか？　今、忙しいんですけど。", "zh": "……啊，那个魔法狂热狂……\n找我有什么事吗？我现在很忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "f651b7f02645076f89db4b6188f19e2cbec33f63a9299543f4c29e8032f32abd", "ja": "ふふっ、そんなに警戒しないでください。\nちょっと、あなたに興味があるだけなんです。", "zh": "呵呵，请别这么警惕。\n我只是对你有点感兴趣而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "de680f3b9cdfc422277713f0acdcc9a4d41830decf22de78fa0d64fbc6922b04", "ja": "魔瞳の大鷲には、古代魔法を好む生徒が多いですけど。\n星梨花さんは何故、古代魔法が好きなのかなぁって。", "zh": "魔瞳大鹫里有很多喜欢古代魔法的学生。不过，我就是有点好奇，星梨花小姐为什么喜欢古代魔法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "6b003a0f6f306f1f64eea92b8bc516aa627a825ff8d3635a74251bf22820b772", "ja": "何故、ですって？　あなたもわからないんですか？\nはぁ……そんなの、言うまでもないでしょ。", "zh": "为什么？你也不知道吗？\n唉……这种事，不是显而易见的吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "e87a2578a00ad70f503de927370f285cd5f23fb7f3f171fc1c748e0646a9c699", "ja": "古代魔法こそ、唯一にして至高の魔法だからです。", "zh": "因为古代魔法才是唯一且至高无上的魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1011_serikanotiti", "source_sha256": "82b3e15cd66cf17c277d8909fde81808355f8478103dbb60ed8678db93af73e8", "ja": "おお、星梨花……！　お前は私の希望……。\nお前ほどの才があれば、きっと奴らを見返せる……。", "zh": "哦，星梨花……！你就是我的希望……。\n只要有你这样的才能，一定能让那些家伙刮目相看……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1012_serikanotiti", "source_sha256": "5a96099c5d21cef42a3778d8c7619c3cd3288bb892595be20bd0167639fe0523", "ja": "古代魔法の素晴らしさも理解せず、我らを一族から\n追い出した、あの連中に……ゴホッ！　ゲホッ！", "zh": "那些连古代魔法的美妙之处都无法理解，还把我们赶出家族的家伙们……咳咳！咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "bcf7e7317ee34b15991fca1fdbe3a1a1e33242e242296aa611556aff459a73ce", "ja": "パパ！　無理して喋らないで……！", "zh": "爸爸！别勉强说话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1014_serikanotiti", "source_sha256": "7febb38984cf096e25fa2d51e7d36b65ff26f9534dee2f4372f6a8f8a532c813", "ja": "古代魔法こそ、唯一にして至高の魔法！\n復活させ、御三家の座を取り戻す事が我が悲願！", "zh": "古代魔法才是唯一至高的魔法！\n让它复活、夺回御三家之位，正是我毕生的夙愿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1015_serikanotiti", "source_sha256": "1b6102d7ddda7ac6078a70e542695ec52fe0ab984a0dc4954906bf24b987aa63", "ja": "星梨花、お前ならきっと……きっと……。\nゴホッ、ゴホッ……！", "zh": "星梨花，如果是你的话，一定……一定能……  \n咳、咳……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "36bdbf91b07cc5524ed12836abd606ea941e1a2ddf38d80ce1eedf11d434d93d", "ja": "（パパの願いを叶えるためにも、わたしは必ず、\n古代魔法を復活させてみせる。そして……！）", "zh": "（为了实现爸爸的愿望，我一定要让古代魔法复活。然后……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "46e39614bd4cb3ca9dde0167f4ac87bdc122ac410c5dfcff6f5d56edff2d0ec3", "ja": "なるほど、なるほど……ふふっ。\n……ねえ、星梨花さぁん？", "zh": "原来如此，原来如此……呵呵。\n……那个，星梨花小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "324a56a876454eca0f876ac67d4be601973af73b230c4d9e75adafb365f13c77", "ja": "私のお願いを聞いてくれるなら……学園の中にある、\n古代魔法にとても近い場所を教えてあげますよ♪", "zh": "如果你愿意听听我的请求……我就告诉你学院里一个非常接近古代魔法的地方哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "e9e97ced7e25294a77ec87119b4afcb6be6461f96b50eaa397b7922e09b52e28", "ja": "えっ！？　学園の中に、そんなところが……。\nけど、お願いって……？", "zh": "诶！？学园里居然还有那种地方……  \n不过，你说的请求是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "ca10cd82fdc499d64859fdd31dfebb08fe1d5b630ca8fabde4cbf989b4870858", "ja": "実は私のパートナー……エレナさんが、\n戦う相手がいなくて、退屈してしまってるんです。", "zh": "其实我的搭档……艾莲娜她，\n因为没有交手的对象，正觉得无聊呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "e4dc14ce7cadfaa00cc2a11ffbce872a2fe46f57cf1130f77887fe39c452f8fe", "ja": "なので、パートナーの星梨花さんから、\n千鶴さんにお願いしてもらえないかなーって！", "zh": "所以，我想拜托我的搭档星梨花，去请千鹤小姐帮个忙——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "57dc83bf378be08e2fedc68603e15aef2da4e9c51cfbee79baab32edad675cca", "ja": "千鶴さんに……ですか？", "zh": "是要拜托千鹤小姐……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "5016d1194c259e08cb6937f05bf68e9058a094de2ece2d5821b4753ebbed1d4e", "ja": "はい！　紋章は、魔法使いにとって原点のようなもの。\n千鶴さんと星梨花さんの召喚魔法も、そうですよね？", "zh": "是的！徽章对于魔法师来说，就像是根本一样的存在。\n千鹤小姐和星梨花小姐的召唤魔法也是如此吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "1a62a28b6df2617d54925c33fc74b622dce2da4becd0e93137ec7ee044b99e80", "ja": "ええ、まあ……。\nでもそれなら、わたしが相手しましょうか？", "zh": "嗯，这个嘛……\n不过既然如此，要不要由我来对付？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "31e3c1c76399492ce9b2b5e5c09e2f72a67a1aa1ed47b96950687dab1ec61cd1", "ja": "いえいえ、あなたには古代魔法を研究するという\n大事なお仕事があるじゃないですか！　それに……。", "zh": "不不，您不是还有研究古代魔法这个重要工作吗！而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "26f208806692094bbcd9a2726fc9ecf8324b664808ae1e5a93231b99b474c7d9", "ja": "あなたより、千鶴さんのほうが強いですから。\nエレナさんは、強い人と戦いたいんですよ♪", "zh": "而且千鹤小姐也比你更强。\n艾莲娜小姐是想和强者交手哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "2d0895ce416feeebf905ebb788c7f80f4dc4d7c515414260bdd1b8770e26e1fe", "ja": "っ……！\nわかりました。わたしが何とかします。", "zh": "呃……！\n我明白了。我会想办法的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "ba2bb03fddacca000f5182000519de36a170e33f8e9c1a480b83588e09e13c3d", "ja": "生命の音色……その遠き旅路のうちに、\nひと時の安らぎよあれ……クラマ・ハ、クラップ！", "zh": "生命的音色……愿这遥远的旅途中，\n能有片刻安宁……克拉玛・哈，鼓掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1029_se", "source_sha256": "9c7adab66b718218d3ba194ce733c7bd6708682d4f58fab9094ca6f3bb5c1544", "ja": "キラキラキラ……☆", "zh": "闪闪发光……☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1030_seito", "source_sha256": "357206217edd3b5383d06b75379d11f860d796cf61952d6d1a5cb29468a7b93c", "ja": "あっ、痛みが引いてきた……。\n歌織さん、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "啊，疼痛减轻了……\n歌织小姐，非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "0ce9a114059d830ea0a9ce968a7734e3686302a2dd0f3230e542f2a3d7ade95d", "ja": "どういたしまして。\nでも、もう無理しちゃダメですよ。……ふぅ。", "zh": "不客气。\n不过，你可不能再勉强自己了。……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "32f20da8fd89b2218251544f8c8b07b0a628960b501ce95af92ac3de68db141a", "ja": "お疲れさま、歌織。とても的確な魔法だったわ。\nあなたの治癒魔法は、もっと評価されるべきよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，歌织。真是非常精准的魔法。\n你的治愈魔法，应该得到更高的评价才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "23e4aaebaf66f287949dea42ff6b2e24d52a555295b0bedca5f6bd4f96b6847d", "ja": "ふふ。治癒魔法は低級な魔法ってよく言われるけど……\n風花ちゃんが褒めてくれるから、それだけで嬉しいわ。", "zh": "呵呵。治疗魔法常被说成是低级魔法，不过……因为风花夸奖我，光是这样就让我很开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4141f181d6c0f7b063ae360a506ddd09c5d1a2af6d3abf73198040473f1413cb", "ja": "そんなやつがいたら、吹き飛ばしてやるわ。\n……それにしても、近ごろケガをする生徒が多いわね。", "zh": "要是有那种人，我就把他吹飞。  \n……话说回来，最近受伤的学生还真多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "7514bdb82b63172a281b563463e06b44b02b94841b600563aa93251f1c5f0dfc", "ja": "うん。理由はまちまちだし、偶然だとは思うけど……\nケガをした人から、変な気配を感じることがあるの。", "zh": "嗯。理由各不相同，我觉得应该只是偶然……但有时，会从受伤的人身上感觉到一股奇怪的气息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cb0a056db0df4f4374c5921a24ec990333b40012952b7a951ff9d4862ea4044b", "ja": "……あなたも気付いたなら、勘違いじゃないのかも。\nちょっと、学園内を調べてみるわ。", "zh": "……既然你也察觉到了，那或许就不是我的错觉。\n我去调查一下学校里面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1037_052kao", "source_sha256": "3f22cd0ce3c733c486a3867aba9d297ae98de4dd9da629d31ba96d79df5f65fe", "ja": "なら、私も一緒に……！", "zh": "那我也一起去……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "317ebfbbbc27293c9c1cabb914161f99a29648fe18bad3c4b98dcb1acf23bea6", "ja": "私はひとりで大丈夫だから、あなたはここにいて。\nまたケガをした生徒が来るかもしれないし。ね？", "zh": "我一个人没问题的，你就留在这里吧。说不定还会有受伤的学生过来。好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_02_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "c19a2171840a303321f49ac7fa7a582327354d00ceca233d49872c06c82c5d06", "ja": "あ……そう、そうよね。\nわかったわ……。", "zh": "啊……对，你说得对。\n我明白了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
